						<p class="pDate">Tuesday, November 27, 2001</p>
						<p class="pTitle">Guild List Update 
						</p>
						<p class=pText>
						FOr all of you that are visiting, please take a minute out and go to the "GUILDS" section.  See your Guild Listed?  If you do, please click on it and make sure the URL is ACCURATE.  If it is NOT accurate, please post a note here or under "SUBMIT NEWS ITEM".  Do NOT see your Guild listed and have web addy handy, again... please post a note here or under "SUBMIT NEWS ITEM".  I will be updating the list to complete accuracy.  If a Guild has an incorrect or non working web addy, I will be removing the URL and direct right back to this page.  Thanks for everyone's help who has given me information on their Guilds in game.  Much appreciated!  Let's all keep SolusekRo.com the Best it can be as well as Our Server!<BR>Travel safe and Be well!  Adrastea
						<br>
						 - Adrastea<BR><BR>
						</p>
